The files under std/capnp/ (the Cap'n Proto standard schema files) are included unchanged from the
Cap'n Proto distribution so that imports such as "/capnp/c++.capnp" resolve exactly as with the
official compiler. They remain under the MIT License of the Cap'n Proto project (copyright as above);
std/capnp/rust.capnp comes from capnproto-rust (MIT, David Renshaw and contributors).

